WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.382
In security, there are a
few words you have to know.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.160
Your risk doesn’t live in one place.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.600
It’s scattered across
clouds, cloud scanners,

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.640
spreadsheets, AI agents, chat sessions,

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.220
and GRC systems.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.970
AiVRIC Enterprise Vision brings
your organization into one view.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.230
See your organization clearly.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.030
Your cloud accounts,
resources, and findings,

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.620
across business units and regions.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:31.880
Score.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.975
Turn thousands of checks
into a security score

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.920
