00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.100
Keep overdue actions in view.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.580
Report. ROAR turns the picture
into risks, opportunities,

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.534
and a roadmap ready for the boardroom.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.410
Govern.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.850
Bring controls, risks,
and compliance together.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.250
Multiple frameworks.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.790
One governed view across your organization.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:06.800
Monitor.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.875
Keep risk posture in view,

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.615
with threat intelligence connected

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.720
to what you actually run.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.610
Decide. Treatments and
exceptions wait for your call.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:22.077
Record the decision, the
rationale, and the next step.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.660
Trust. When customers
ask, share approved proof.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.295
A living trust center, with control over

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.200
