00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.480
Eight words. One organization.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.880
Your program. One picture.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.650
Built for your teams, your regions,

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.807
and your governance requirements.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.690
AiVRIC Enterprise Vision.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.110
See It.

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.450
Score It.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:50.670
